==Battleground==
*1 [[Zir Zeal]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*12 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
*3 [[Zory|Zories]] spawn after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>, delay 23.33~26.67 seconds<sup>700f~800f</sup>.
*1 [[Zir Zeal]] spawns after 93.33 seconds<sup>2,800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
As the Zir Zeal and Zories are not buffed, they can be defeated by your general Zombie Killers. [[Vaulter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Housewife Cat]] is a great option for damage. The peons here might be a bit annoying because Aku Doge has a [[Shield]] while Cerberus Kids have a chance to Freeze. However, neither should be a problem. Spammable DPS units such as [[Mer-Cat (Rare Cat)|Cameraman Cat]] and [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]] should handle them while also taking care of the Zir Zeal and Zories.

